{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If visible, approach, if movable, move or call for help, then analyze and perform task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectMovable    /> <Action ID = CallForHelp    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <SubTree ID = AnalyzeObject    /> <Action ID = PerformSpecificTask    />",
